features":"not gonna say too much js try it if you can read lua you can tell js source code scraped up in 10 mins comment and lmk if anyone does anything","tags":[],"script":"local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal player = Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal char = player.Character or player.CharacterAdded:Wait()\nlocal hrp = char:WaitForChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n\nlocal running = false\n\n-- GUI\nlocal gui = Instance.new(\"ScreenGui\")\ngui.Name = \"WallBuilderV2\"\ngui.Parent = player:WaitForChild(\"PlayerGui\")\n\nlocal frame = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nframe.Size = UDim2.new(0,200,0,120)\nframe.Position = UDim2.new(0.5,-100,0.5,-60)\nframe.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(30,30,30)\nframe.Parent = gui\nframe.Active = true\nframe.Draggable = true\n\nlocal startBtn = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\nstartBtn.Size = UDim2.new(1,-20,0,30)\nstartBtn.Position = UDim2.new(0,10,0,10)\nstartBtn.Text = \"Start\"\nstartBtn.Parent = frame\n\nlocal stopBtn = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\nstopBtn.Size = UDim2.new(1,-20,0,30)\nstopBtn.Position = UDim2.new(0,10,0,45)\nstopBtn.Text = \"Stop\"\nstopBtn.Parent = frame\n\nlocal unloadBtn = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\nunloadBtn.Size = UDim2.new(1,-20,0,30)\nunloadBtn.Position = UDim2.new(0,10,0,80)\nunloadBtn.Text = \"Unload\"\nunloadBtn.Parent = frame\n\n\n-- fire closest proximity prompt\nlocal function fireClosestPrompt()\n    local closest\n    local dist = math.huge\n\n    for _,v in ipairs(workspace:GetDescendants()) do\n        if v:IsA(\"ProximityPrompt\") and v.Parent:IsA(\"BasePart\") then\n            local d = (hrp.Position - v.Parent.Position).Magnitude\n            if d < dist then\n                dist = d\n                closest = v\n            end\n        end\n    end\n\n    if closest then\n        fireproximityprompt(closest,1)\n    end\nend\n\n\nlocal function run()\n    while running do\n\n        -- step 1\n        char:PivotTo(CFrame.new(-255,6,-139))\n        task.wait(0.15)\n\n        -- step 2\n        fireClosestPrompt()\n        task.wait(0.15)\n\n        -- step 3 equip brick\n        local tool = player.Backpack:FindFirstChild(\"Brick\")\n        if tool then\n            tool.Parent = char\n        end\n\n        task.wait(0.15)\n\n        -- step 4 scan bricks\n        local bricks = {}\n        for _,v in ipairs(workspace:GetChildren()) do\n            if v:IsA(\"BasePart\") and v.Name:match(\"^Brick%d+$\") then\n                table.insert(bricks,v)\n            end\n        end\n\n        if #bricks > 0 then\n            local brick = bricks[math.random(1,#bricks)]\n\n            local prompt = brick:FindFirstChild(\"PickupPrompt\")\n            if prompt then\n                fireproximityprompt(prompt,1)\n            end\n\n            task.wait(0.15)\n\n            -- tp to brick\n            char:PivotTo(brick.CFrame + Vector3.new(0,3,0))\n            task.wait(0.15)\n\n            -- fire again\n            fireClosestPrompt()\n        end\n\n        task.wait(0.1)\n    end\nend\n\n\nstartBtn.MouseButton1Click:Connect(function()\n    if not running then\n        running = true\n        task.spawn(run)\n    end\nend)\n\nstopBtn.MouseButton1Click:Connect(function()\n    running = false\nend)\n\nunloadBtn.MouseButton1Click:Connect(function()\n    running = false\n    gui:Destroy()\nend)","owner":{"_id":"68267db8cd6a966a0eba604e","username":"Shape","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"68267db8cd6a966a0eba604e","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"verified":false,"views":543,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/779d5fe2fc671bf7c4bdde0f2c40cf7fc29f845ecf932cc4e2fbd4d9f7af463e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-9f75462b97223913255eb9131014cc1d-db134454a4b0.png","scriptblo